  "summary": "Claymorphism React UI kit with 38 components, 14 blocks and 14 templates, installed shadcn-style.",
  "description": "A puffy, pastel, maximalist UI kit for React: every surface a chunky cushion, styled with Tailwind CSS v4 and built on Radix primitives. Components install into your own repo with the shadcn CLI — there is no runtime package — and share a two-layer CSS custom property theme with dark mode. Ships 38 components with 144 live demos, 14 drop-in blocks (login, pricing, social feed, music player) and 14 route-ready templates (dashboard, CRM, inbox, kanban, storefront).",
